  "title": "TWFG Insurance Services Acquires Panoptic Insurance",
  "summary": "April 21, 2020 THE WOODLANDS, Texas – TWFG Insurance Services, LLC (TWFG), is pleased to announce it has completed the acquisition of Panoptic Insurance’s personal and commercial insurance business. The acquisition is effective April 17, 2020. TWFG Insurance Services is a full-service, national retail insurance agency with over 386 locations in 18 states and approximately […]",
